ko.","5401a608d3ba",2.78],[0,"You can't miss it!","Tikrai nepražiūrėsite!","473e93940b37",1.1],[-1,"Thank you so much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[0,"You're welcome. Enjoy your walk!","Prašom. Gero pasivaikščiojimo!","ffdcc7ff65ee",2.21],[0,"Hello again! Where to this time?","Sveiki dar kartą! Kur šįkart?","0f151847405c",2.41],[-1,"Thank you very much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[-1,"Excuse me, how do I get to Sunny Cup?","Atsiprašau, kaip nueiti į kavinę „Sunny Cup“?",1],[0,"Cross Main Street and turn right. Go straight.","Pereikite Main Street gatvę ir sukite dešinėn. Eikite tiesiai.","08be850c34b7",3.9],[0,"Sunny Cup is on your left, next to Lucia's Trattoria.","Kavinė „Sunny Cup“ bus kairėje, šalia restorano „Lucia's“.","18c27a36144b",4.3],[-1,"Could you speak more slowly, please?","Ar galėtumėte kalbėti lėčiau?",1],[0,"Of course. I'll say it slowly.","Žinoma. Pasakysiu lėtai.","c564d106c37f",2.55],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[-1,"Excuse me, how do I get to the Pier Restaurant?","Atsiprašau, kaip nueiti į restoraną „The Pier“?",1],[0,"Walk down Center Street toward the water.","Eikite Center Street gatve link vandens.","0fa06cde42d0",2.69],[0,"At Harbor Road, turn left. The Pier Restaurant is on your right.","Prie Harbor Road kelio sukite kairėn. Restoranas „The Pier“ bus dešinėje.","72471019ce74",5.43],[-1,"Sorry, could you say that again?","Atsiprašau, ar galėtumėte pakartoti?",1],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[-1,"Sorry, I didn't catch that.","Atsiprašau, nenugirdau.",1],[0,"Of course.","Žinoma.","12c99c56a962",0.89],[-1,"Goodbye!","Viso gero!",1],[0,"Sure, I'll speak more slowly.","Žinoma, kalbėsiu lėčiau.","a2830da218e8",2.39],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"No problem.","Jokių problemų.","0e110fbce9c0",0.91],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"Sure!","Žinoma!","a83b74226eb0",0.85],[-1,"Pretty good, thanks!","Visai gerai, ačiū!",1],[-1,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1]],"c